facts requis","Évaluation de la préparation pour la livraison","Rapport de résultats avec des gaps spécifiques"],"de":["Laden von Tor-Kriterien aus PRD.md","Überprüfung von Beweisen und erforderlichen Artefakten","Bewertung der Vorbereitung für die Übergabe","Bericht über die Ergebnisse mit spezifischen Lücken"],"pt":["Carregamento de critérios de porta a partir do PRD.md","Verificação de evidências com IDs válidos","Avaliação de prontidão para entrega","Relatório de aprovação ou bloqueio com lacunas específicas"],"ru":["Загрузка критериев шлюза из PRD.md","Проверка доказательств с действительными ID","Оценка готовности к сдаче","Отчет о согласовании или блокировке с конкретными пробелами"],"ar":["تحميل معايير البوابة من PRD.md","التحقق من الأدلة بIDs صالحة","تقييم الجاهزية للتسليم","التقرير عن الموافقة أو الحجب مع الفجوات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ghm-gate-check","ghm-gate-check setup guide","ghm-gate-check alternative","ghm-gate-check vs manual validation","PRD validation tools","AI-powered product development","context-aware development workflows","ghm-gate-check install"],"zh":["AI 代理工具","PRD 驱动的上下文工程","ghm-gate-check","加载门槛标准","验证证据","评估准备就绪性","报告生成","AI 开发"],"ja":["AI エージェントツール","PRD ドリブンのコンテキストエンジニアリング","ghm-gate-check","ゲート基準の読み込み","証拠の検証","準備就绪性の評価","レポートの生成","AI 開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 도구","PRD 주도 컨텍스트 엔지니어링","ghm-gate-check","게이트 기준 읽기","증거 검증","준비 완료 평가","보고서 생성","AI 개발"],"es":["herramientas de IA","validación de criterios de puerta","desarrollo de productos de IA","flujo de trabajo de IA","PRD.md","evidencia y artefactos","evaluación de preparación"],"fr":["outils d''IA","validation des critères de passerelle","développement de produits d''IA","flux de travail d''IA","PRD.md","preuves et artefacts","évaluation de la préparation"],"de":["KI-Tools","Validierung von Tor-Kriterien","Entwicklung von KI-Produkten","Arbeitsablauf von KI","PRD.md","Beweise und Artefakte","Bewertung der Vorbereitung"],"pt":["ghm-gate-check","validação de critérios de porta","desenvolvimento de produtos AI","documentação progressiva","fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento","PRD.md","evidências","IDs válidos"],"ru":["ghm-gate-check","проверка критериев шлюза","разработка продуктов ИИ","прогрессивная документация","рабочие процессы разработки","PRD.md","доказательства","действительные ID"],"ar":["ghm-gate-check","التحقق من معايير البوابة","تطوير منتجات الذكاء الاصطناعي","توثيق تدريجي","عمليات عمل متطورة","PRD.md","الأدلة","IDs صالحة"]}},"owner":"mattgierhart","repo":"PRD-driven-context-engineering","repoPath":"mattgierhart/PRD-driven-context-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ghm-gate-check","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Gate Check\n\nValidate all gate criteria are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Load Gate Criteria** → Read target gate requirements from PRD.md\n2. **Verify Evidence** → Check required artifacts exist with valid IDs\n3. **Assess Readiness** → Evaluate handoff requirements\n4. **Report** → Pass/Block with specific gaps\n\n## Core Output Template\n\n| Element | Definition | Evidence |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **Target Gate** | Version being validated","body":"# Gate Check\n\nValidate all gate criteria are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Load Gate Criteria** → Read target gate requirements from PRD.md\n2. **Verify Evidence** → Check required artifacts exist with valid IDs\n3. **Assess Readiness** → Evaluate handoff requirements\n4. **Report** → Pass/Block with specific gaps\n\n## Core Output Template\n\n| Element | Definition | Evidence |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **Target Gate** | Version being validated | `v0.3 → v0.4` |\n| **Status** | Pass or Block | Clear determination |\n| **Missing Artifacts** | What''s not complete | Specific list with IDs |\n| **Recommendation** | Action to take | Proceed / Address gaps |\n\n## Gate Reference\n\n| Gate | Focus | Key Artifacts |\n|------|-------|---------------|\n| v0.1 → v0.2 | Problem validated | CFD-XXX evidence |\n| v0.2 → v0.3 | Market defined | Segment definitions |\n| v0.3 → v0.4 | Commercial viable | BR-XXX, pricing |\n| v0.4 → v0.5 | Journeys mapped | UJ-XXX complete |\n| v0.5 → v0.6 | Risks addressed | Risk register |\n| v0.6 → v0.7 | Architecture set | API-XXX, schemas |\n| v0.7 → v0.8 | Build complete | Tests passing |\n| v0.8 → v0.9 | Deployed | Live environment |\n| v0.9 → v1.0 | Launched | Metrics tracking |\n\n## Step 1: Load Gate Criteria\n\n1. Read PRD.md gate section for target version\n2. Extract all required criteria\n3. Identify artifact types needed (BR, UJ, API, CFD)\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] Target gate identified\n- [ ] All criteria extracted\n- [ ] Required artifact types listed\n\n## Step 2: Verify Evidence\n\nFor each required criterion:\n\n1. Check artifact exists in SoT/\n2. Verify artifact status is not \"Draft\"\n3. Confirm cross-references are valid\n4. Check for required CFD-XXX evidence\n\n### Evidence Matrix\n\n| Criterion Type | Verification |\n|----------------|--------------|\n| Business Rule | BR-XXX exists, status Active |\n| User Journey | UJ-XXX exists, all steps defined |\n| API Contract | API-XXX exists, endpoints specified |\n| Customer Evidence | CFD-XXX linked to BR-XXX |\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] All required BR-XXX verified\n- [ ] All required UJ-XXX verified\n- [ ] All required API-XXX verified\n- [ ] Evidence chain (CFD → BR) validated\n\n## Step 3: Assess Handoff Readiness\n\nCheck downstream requirements:\n\n1. Next agent has context needed\n2. No open blockers in current EPIC\n3. Documentation is current\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] EPIC Session State section has no blockers\n- [ ] README.md is synchronized\n- [ ] Handoff documentation exists\n\n## Step 4: Generate Report\n\n```markdown\n## Gate Check Report: v0.X → v0.Y\n\n**Status**: [PASS / BLOCK]\n**Date**: YYYY-MM-DD\n\n### Criteria Assessment\n\n| Criterion | Status | Evidence |\n|-----------|--------|----------|\n| [Criterion 1] | ✅/❌ | [ID or gap] |\n| [Criterion 2] | ✅/❌ | [ID or gap] |\n\n### Missing Artifacts\n- [ ] [Specific gap with required action]\n\n### Recommendation\n[Proceed to v0.Y / Address [N] gaps before advancing]\n```\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n### Pass Checklist\n- [ ] All criteria evaluated (none skipped)\n- [ ] Evidence is traceable to IDs\n- [ ] Recommendation is actionable\n\n### Testability Check\n- [ ] Report can be validated against PRD.md criteria\n- [ ] Missing artifacts are specific and findable\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Example | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Skipping criteria | \"Probably fine\" | → Verify each explicitly |\n| Vague gaps | \"Needs more work\" | → Cite specific missing ID |\n| Override blocks | Advancing despite fails | → Address gaps first |\n\n## Boundaries\n\n**DO**:\n- Validate against documented criteria\n- Identify specific gaps\n- Provide actionable recommendations\n\n**DON''T**:\n- Create missing artifacts (just report)\n- Override gate blocks\n- Make subjective quality judgments\n\n## Handoff\n\nAfter gate check:\n- If PASS: Advance PRD version, trigger `ghm-status-sync`\n- If BLOCK: Return to current stage, address gaps\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:12.134Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated PRD lifecycle validation and gate criteria checking.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化PRD生命周期验证和门槛标准检查的开发代理","ja":"自動化されたPRDライフサイクル検証とゲート基準のチェックが必要な開発エージェントに最適","ko":"자동화된 PRD 생명주기 유효성 검사 및 게이트 기준 확인이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una validación automatizada del ciclo de vida de PRD y comprobación de criterios de puerta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une validation automatique du cycle de vie de PRD et d''une vérification des critères de porte.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Validierung des PRD-Lebenszyklus und eine Überprüfung der Torfreigabekriterien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de validação automatizada do ciclo de vida do PRD e verificação de critérios de gateway.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная проверка жизненного цикла PRD и проверка критериев шлюза.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق الآلي من دورة حياة PRD و التحقق من معايير البوابة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate PRD lifecycle versions by checking gate criteria and ensuring required artifacts exist, utilizing Markdown files like PRD.md and assessing handoff requirements.","zh":"赋予代理验证PRD生命周期版本的能力，通过检查门槛标准并确保所需的工件存在，利用Markdown文件（如PRD.md）并评估交接要求","ja":"PRDライフサイクルバージョンの検証をエージェントに可能にし、ゲート基準のチェックと必要な成果物の存在の確認を行い、Markdownファイル（例：PRD.md）を使用してハンドオフ要件を評価する","ko":"에이전트가 PRD 생명주기 버전을 유효성 검사할 수 있도록 하며, 게이트 기준을 확인하고 필요한 아티팩트가 존재하는지 확인하고, 마크다운 파일(PRD.md 등)을 사용하여 인도 요구 사항을 평가함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar versiones del ciclo de vida de PRD comprobando los criterios de puerta y asegurando la existencia de artefactos requeridos, utilizando archivos Markdown como PRD.md y evaluando los requisitos de entrega.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les versions du cycle de vie de PRD en vérifiant les critères de porte et en s''assurant de l''existence d''artefacts requis, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que PRD.md et en évaluant les exigences de passation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PRD-Lebenszyklusversionen zu validieren, indem sie die Torfreigabekriterien überprüfen und sicherstellen, dass die erforderlichen Artefakte vorhanden sind, indem sie Markdown-Dateien wie PRD.md verwenden und die Anforderungen an die Handübernahme bewerten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar as versões do ciclo de vida do PRD, verificando os critérios de gateway e garantindo a existência de artefatos necessários, utilizando arquivos Markdown como PRD.md e avaliando os requisitos de handoff.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность проверить версии жизненного цикла PRD, проверив критерии шлюза и обеспечив наличие необходимых артефактов, используя файлы Markdown, такие как PRD.md, и оценивая требования к передаче.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من إصدارات دورة حياة PRD من خلال التحقق من معايير البوابة وضمان وجود الملفات المطلوبة، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل PRD.md وتقييم متطلبات التسليم."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating gate check validation for PRD lifecycle versions","Verifying evidence of required artifacts with valid IDs","Assessing readiness for handoff requirements"],"zh":["自动化PRD生命周期版本的门槛检查验证","验证所需工件的证据，具有有效的ID","评估交接要求的准备情况"],"ja":["PRDライフサイクルバージョンのゲートチェックの検証を自動化","必要な成果物の証拠を検証し、有効なIDを持つ","ハンドオフ要件の準備状況を評価"],"ko":["PRD 생명주기 버전의 게이트 체크 유효성 검사를 자동화","필요한 아티팩트의 증거를 검증하고 유효한 ID를 가짐","인도 요구 사항의 준비 상황을 평가"],"es":["Automatizar la validación de la comprobación de puerta para versiones del ciclo de vida de PRD","Verificar la evidencia de artefactos requeridos con IDs válidas","Evaluar la preparación para los requisitos de entrega"],"fr":["Automatiser la validation de la vérification de porte pour les versions du cycle de vie de PRD","Vérifier la preuve d''artefacts requis avec des IDs valides","Évaluer la préparation aux exigences de passation"],"de":["Automatisieren der Validierung der Torfreigabekontrolle für PRD-Lebenszyklusversionen","Überprüfen des Nachweises erforderlicher Artefakte mit gültigen IDs","Bewerten der Vorbereitung auf die Anforderungen an die Handübernahme"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de gateway para versões do ciclo de vida do PRD","Verificar a evidência de artefatos necessários com IDs válidos","Avaliar a prontidão para os requisitos de handoff"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку шлюза для версий жизненного цикла PRD","Проверить доказательства необходимых артефактов с действительными идентификаторами","Оценить готовность к требованиям передачи"],"ar":["التحقق الآلي من بوابة التحقق من إصدارات دورة حياة PRD","التحقق من وجود الملفات المطلوبة ذات المعرفات الصالحة","تقييم جاهزية متطلبات التسليم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to PRD.md files","Limited to gate criteria defined in PRD.md"],"zh":["需要访问PRD.md文件","仅限于PRD.md中定义的门槛标准"],"ja":["PRD.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","PRD.mdで定義されたゲート基準のみに限定"],"ko":["PRD.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","PRD.md에서 정의된 게이트 기준만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos PRD.md","Limitado a los criterios de puerta definidos en PRD.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers PRD.md","Limité aux critères de porte définis dans PRD.md"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf PRD.md-Dateien","Begrenzt auf die in PRD.md definierten Torfreigabekriterien"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos PRD.md","Limitado aos critérios de gateway definidos em PRD.md"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам PRD.md","Ограничен критериями шлюза, определёнными в PRD.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات PRD.md","محدود بمعايير البوابة المحددة في PRD.md"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a4f2f571a18da68b322e3e5b314158946ae8127be8c3bf45739314dac8a3e135","qualityScore":45}');
