INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('KaziNizamul/SaveMyTax/appstore-readiness', 'appstore-readiness', 'KaziNizamul', 'SaveMyTax', 'community', 'appstore-readiness KaziNizamul SaveMyTax community The appstore-readiness skill helps developers achieve first-submission App Store approval by providing specialized agents for compliance auditing, UI/UX review, and privacy compliance. It benefits developers seeking to ensure their iOS apps meet Apple''s guidelines. 我们的 App Store 准备技能提供了九个专门的代理，帮助您实现首次提交的 App Store 审批，涵盖审查、设计和隐私等方面 App Store 対応セットアップガイドは、9 つの専門エージェントを提供し、初回提出での App Store 審査を通過するための支援を提供します。審査、設計、プライバシーなどを網羅しています App Store 준비 설정 가이드는 9개의 전문 에이전트를 제공하여 첫 번째 제출 승인을 위한 App Store 심사를 통과하기 위한 지원을 제공합니다. 심사, 디자인, 개인정보 보호 등 다양한 측면을 다룹니다 La habilidad de preparación para la App Store de Apple ayuda a los desarrolladores a asegurarse de que sus aplicaciones cumplan con las normas de Apple. La compétence de préparation de l''App Store d''Apple aide les développeurs à s''assurer que leurs applications répondent aux normes d''Apple. Die App Store-Readiness-Fähigkeit hilft Entwicklern dabei, sicherzustellen, dass ihre Apps die Apple-Standards erfüllen. Os agentes de prontidão da App Store são especializados em garantir a aprovação na primeira submissão. Eles oferecem auditoria de conformidade, revisão de UI/UX e especialização em privacidade. Агенты для подготовки к App Store специализируются на обеспечении одобрения при первом подаче. Они предлагают аудит соответствия, проверку UI/UX и специализацию в области приватности. الوكلاء لجاهزية متجر التطبيقات متخصصون في ضمان الموافقة في الإرسال الأول. يقدمون تدقيق الامتثال ومراجعة واجهة المستخدم وخبرة في مجال الخصوصية. how to use appstore-readiness appstore-readiness setup guide appstore-readiness alternative appstore-readiness vs competitor what is appstore-readiness appstore-readiness install achieving App Store approval iOS app submission process App Store review guidelines App Store 准备 iOS 应用开发 首次提交审批 审查和设计 隐私和数据保护 UI/UX 设计 Apple 人机界面指南 AIエージェント App Store 審査 Pre-submission audit using Reviewer agent for compliance auditing UI/UX review using Designer agent with Apple Design Evangelist expertise Privacy compliance checking using Privacy agent for ATT and label management Expertise in Apple Human Interface Guidelines (HIG) for design patterns Support for App Store approval process with Senior App Review expertise appstore-readiness is a set of specialized agents for achieving first-submission App Store approval, including Reviewer, Designer, and Privacy agents with expertise in Apple Design Evangelist and Privacy Compliance Specialist roles.');
