velopment? Это навык для создания пользовательских компонентов Livewire","ar":"ما هو Livewire Development؟ إنه مهارة لإنشاء مكونات Livewire مخصصة"},"features":{"en":["Creates and modifies Livewire components using wire: directives","Implements islands for efficient rendering and async actions for seamless user experience","Utilizes wire: model, click, loading, sort, and intersect directives for dynamic functionality","Supports writing Livewire component tests for robust quality assurance","Follows project conventions outlined in .ai/guidelines/project-guideline for consistency"],"zh":["使用 wire: 指令（model、click、loading、sort、intersect）","实现 islands 或 async 动作","编写 Livewire 组件测试","创建和修改 Livewire 组件","使用 Livewire 4 模式和文档"],"ja":["wire: ディレクティブ（model、click、loading、sort、intersect）を使用","islands または async アクションを実装","Livewire コンポーネントのテストを記述","Livewire コンポーネントの作成と変更","Livewire 4 パターンとドキュメントを使用"],"ko":["wire: 지시자（model、click、loading、sort、intersect）사용","아일랜드 또는 비동기 동작 구현","Livewire 컴포넌트 테스트 작성","Livewire 컴포넌트 생성 및 수정","Livewire 4 패턴 및 문서 사용"],"es":["Crear y modificar componentes Livewire","Usar directivas wire: como model, click, loading, sort y intersect","Implementar islas y acciones asíncronas","Escribir pruebas de componentes Livewire","Utilizar patrones y documentación de Livewire 4"],"fr":["Créer et modifier des composants Livewire","Utiliser des directivas wire: comme model, click, loading, sort et intersect","Mettre en œuvre des îles et des actions asynchrones","Écrire des tests de composants Livewire","Utiliser des modèles et une documentation de Livewire 4"],"de":["Erstellen und modifizieren von Livewire-Komponenten","Verwenden von wire: Direktiven wie model, click, loading, sort und intersect","Implementieren von Inseln und asynchronen Aktionen","Schreiben von Livewire-Komponententests","Verwenden von Livewire 4-Mustern und -Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação e modificação de componentes Livewire","Uso de diretrizes wire: model, click, loading, sort e intersect","Implementação de ações assíncronas e ilhas","Escrita de testes para componentes Livewire","Integração com padrões de documentação Livewire 4"],"ru":["Создание и модификация компонентов Livewire","Использование директив wire: model, click, loading, sort и intersect","Реализация асинхронных действий и островов","Написание тестов для компонентов Livewire","Интеграция с документацией Livewire 4"],"ar":["إنشاء وتعديل مكونات Livewire","استخدام توجيهات wire: model, click, loading, sort و intersect","تنفيذ إجراءات متزامنة وجزر","كتابة اختبارات لمكونات Livewire","التكامل مع توثيق Livewire 4"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use livewire-development","livewire-development setup guide","what is livewire-development","livewire-development vs laravel","livewire-development install","livewire-development tutorial for beginners","livewire-development best practices","livewire-development documentation","livewire-development examples"],"zh":["Livewire 开发","wire: 指令","Livewire 组件测试","Livewire 4 模式","islands 和 async 动作","AIエージェント","Livewire 开发最佳实践"],"ja":["Livewire 開発","wire: ディレクティブ","Livewire コンポーネントのテスト","Livewire 4 パターン","islands と async アクション","AIエージェント","Livewire 開発ガイド"],"ko":["Livewire 개발","wire: 지시자","Livewire 컴포넌트 테스트","Livewire 4 패턴","아일랜드와 비동기 동작","AI 에이전트","Livewire 개발 Setup Guide"],"es":["Livewire Development","componentes Livewire","wire: directivas","pruebas de componentes","Livewire 4","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","Agentes de IA para desarrollo"],"fr":["Livewire Development","composants Livewire","directivas wire:","tests de composants","Livewire 4","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","Outils d''IA pour le développement"],"de":["Livewire Development","Livewire-Komponenten","wire: Direktiven","Komponententests","Livewire 4","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["Livewire Development","componentes Livewire","diretrizes wire","ações assíncronas","testes de unidade","padrões de documentação Livewire 4","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Livewire Development","компоненты Livewire","директивы wire","асинхронные действия","юнит-тесты","документация Livewire 4","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Livewire Development","مكونات Livewire","توجيهات wire","إجراءات متزامنة","اختبارات الوحدة","توثيق Livewire 4","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الإي آي","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"TijmenWierenga","repo":"fitapp","repoPath":"TijmenWierenga/fitapp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.419Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"livewire-development","description":"Develops reactive Livewire 4 components. Activates when creating, updating, or modifying Livewire components; working with wire:model, wire:click, wire:loading, or any wire: directives; adding real-time updates, loading states, or reactivity; debugging component behavior; writing Livewire tests; or when the user mentions Livewire, component, counter, or reactive UI.","bodyPreview":"# Livewire Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying Livewire components\n- Using wire: directives (model, click, loading, sort, intersect)\n- Implementing islands or async actions\n- Writing Livewire component tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Livewire 4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Project Conventions\n\nThese conventions are specific to this project. When proposing changes to these conventions, update `.ai/guidelines/project-guidelin","body":"# Livewire Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying Livewire components\n- Using wire: directives (model, click, loading, sort, intersect)\n- Implementing islands or async actions\n- Writing Livewire component tests\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Livewire 4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Project Conventions\n\nThese conventions are specific to this project. When proposing changes to these conventions, update `.ai/guidelines/project-guidelines.md`.\n\n### Authorization\n\nUse `$this->authorize()` with policies in Livewire action methods. Use `#[CurrentUser]` for injecting the authenticated user instead of the `Auth` facade.\n\n<!-- Livewire Authorization -->\n```php\n// Good\nuse Illuminate\\Container\\Attributes\\CurrentUser;\n\npublic function saveReport(#[CurrentUser] User $user): void\n{\n    $this->authorize(''create'', [InjuryReport::class, $this->injury]);\n    // ...\n}\n\n// Bad\npublic function saveReport(): void\n{\n    if (Auth::id() !== $this->injury->user_id) {\n        return;\n    }\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\nAuthorize at the action level (e.g. `saveReport`, `deleteReport`), not in `mount()`. This keeps authorization close to the mutation and leverages policies consistently.\n\n### Mount Methods\n\nOmit `mount()` when it only assigns typed public properties — Livewire handles this automatically.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Components\n\n<!-- Component Creation Commands -->\n```bash\n\n# Single-file component (default in v4)\n\n{{ $assist->artisanCommand(''make:livewire create-post'') }}\n\n# Multi-file component\n\n{{ $assist->artisanCommand(''make:livewire create-post --mfc'') }}\n\n# Class-based component (v3 style)\n\n{{ $assist->artisanCommand(''make:livewire create-post --class'') }}\n\n# With namespace\n\n{{ $assist->artisanCommand(''make:livewire Posts/CreatePost'') }}\n```\n\n### Converting Between Formats\n\nUse `php artisan livewire:convert create-post` to convert between single-file, multi-file, and class-based formats.\n\n### Component Format Reference\n\n| Format | Flag | Structure |\n|--------|------|-----------|\n| Single-file (SFC) | default | PHP + Blade in one file |\n| Multi-file (MFC) | `--mfc` | Separate PHP class, Blade, JS, tests |\n| Class-based | `--class` | Traditional v3 style class |\n| View-based | ⚡ prefix | Blade-only with functional state |\n\n### Single-File Component Example\n\n<!-- Single-File Component Example -->\n```php\n<?php\nuse Livewire\\Component;\n\nnew class extends Component {\n    public int $count = 0;\n\n    public function increment(): void\n    {\n        $this->count++;\n    }\n}\n?>\n\n<div>\n    <button wire:click=\"increment\">Count: @{{ $count }}</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Livewire 4 Specifics\n\n### Key Changes From Livewire 3\n\nThese things changed in Livewire 4, but may not have been updated in this application. Verify this application''s setup to ensure you follow existing conventions.\n\n- Use `Route::livewire()` for full-page components; config keys renamed: `layout` → `component_layout`, `lazy_placeholder` → `component_placeholder`.\n- `wire:model` now ignores child events by default (use `wire:model.deep` for old behavior); `wire:scroll` renamed to `wire:navigate:scroll`.\n- Component tags must be properly closed; `wire:transition` now uses View Transitions API (modifiers removed).\n- JavaScript: `$wire.$js(''name'', fn)` → `$wire.$js.name = fn`; `commit`/`request` hooks → `interceptMessage()`/`interceptRequest()`.\n\n### New Features\n\n- Component formats: single-file (SFC), multi-file (MFC), view-based components.\n- Islands (`@island`) for isolated updates; async actions (`wire:click.async`, `#[Async]`) for parallel execution.\n- Deferred/bundled loading: `defer`, `lazy.bundle` for optimized component loading.\n\n| Feature | Usage | Purpose |\n|---------|-------|---------|\n| Islands | `@island(name: ''stats'')` | Isolated update regions |\n| Async | `wire:click.async` or `#[Async]` | Non-blocking actions |\n| Deferred | `defer` attribute | Load after page render |\n| Bundled | `lazy.bundle` | Load multiple together |\n\n### New Directives\n\n- `wire:sort`, `wire:intersect`, `wire:ref`, `.renderless`, `.preserve-scroll` are available for use.\n- `data-loading` attribute automatically added to elements triggering network requests.\n\n| Directive | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `wire:sort` | Drag-and-drop sorting |\n| `wire:intersect` | Viewport intersection detection |\n| `wire:ref` | Element references for JS |\n| `.renderless` | Component without rendering |\n| `.preserve-scroll` | Preserve scroll position |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always use `wire:key` in loops\n- Use `wire:loading` for loading states\n- Use `wire:model.live` for instant updates (default is debounced)\n- Validate and authorize in actions (treat like HTTP requests)\n\n## Configuration\n\n- `smart_wire_keys` defaults to `true`; new configs: `component_locations`, `component_namespaces`, `make_command`, `csp_safe`.\n\n## Alpine & JavaScript\n\n- `wire:transition` uses browser View Transitions API; `$errors` and `$intercept` magic properties available.\n- Non-blocking `wire:poll` and parallel `wire:model.live` updates improve performance.\n\nFor interceptors and hooks, see [reference/javascript-hooks.md](reference/javascript-hooks.md).\n\n## Testing\n\n<!-- Testing Example -->\n```php\nLivewire::test(Counter::class)\n    ->assertSet(''count'', 0)\n    ->call(''increment'')\n    ->assertSet(''count'', 1);\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n1. Browser console: Check for JS errors\n2. Network tab: Verify Livewire requests return 200\n3. Ensure `wire:key` on all `@foreach` loops\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Missing `wire:key` in loops → unexpected re-rendering\n- Expecting `wire:model` real-time → use `wire:model.live`\n- Unclosed component tags → syntax errors in v4\n- Using deprecated config keys or JS hooks\n- Including Alpine.js separately (already bundled in Livewire 4)"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:22.003Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing advanced Livewire component development capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级 Livewire 组件开发能力的全栈代理。","ja":"高度な Livewire コンポーネント開発機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 Livewire 컴포넌트 개발 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de componentes Livewire avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui nécessitent des capacités de développement de composants Livewire avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Livewire-Komponenten-Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de componentes Livewire.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки компонентов Livewire.","ar":"مثالي لمراقبي الويب الكامل الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير مكونات Livewire."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and modify Livewire components, leveraging wire: directives such as model, click, and loading, while implementing islands or async actions for enhanced user experience, utilizing Livewire 4 patterns and documentation.","zh":"赋予代理创建和修改 Livewire 组件的能力，利用 wire: 指令（如 model、click 和 loading），同时实现岛或异步操作以增强用户体验，利用 Livewire 4 模式和文档。","ja":"エージェントが Livewire コンポーネントを作成および変更できるようにし、wire: ディレクティブ（model、click、loading など）を使用してアイランドまたは非同期アクションを実装し、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させ、Livewire 4 パターンとドキュメントを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Livewire 컴포넌트를 생성하고 수정할 수 있도록 해주며, wire: 지시문(model, click, loading 등)을 사용하여 아일랜드 또는 비동기 동작을 구현하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키고, Livewire 4 패턴과 문서를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y modificar componentes Livewire, aprovechando las directivas wire: como modelo, clic y carga, mientras implementan islas o acciones asíncronas para una experiencia del usuario mejorada, utilizando patrones y documentación de Livewire 4.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de modifier des composants Livewire, en exploitant les directives wire: telles que modèle, clic et chargement, tout en implémentant des îles ou des actions asynchrones pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée, en utilisant des modèles et une documentation Livewire 4.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Livewire-Komponenten zu erstellen und zu ändern, indem sie wire:-Direktiven wie Modell, Klick und Ladevorgang nutzen, während sie Inseln oder asynchrone Aktionen für eine verbesserte Benutzeroberfläche implementieren, unter Verwendung von Livewire-4-Mustern und -Dokumentation.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e modificar componentes Livewire, utilizando diretivas wire: como model, click e loading, ao mesmo tempo em que implementam ilhas ou ações assíncronas para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada, utilizando padrões e documentação do Livewire 4.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и изменять компоненты Livewire, используя директивы wire: такие как model, click и loading, а также реализовывать острова или асинхронные действия для улучшения пользовательского опыта, используя шаблоны и документацию Livewire 4.","ar":"يمكن للمراقبين إنشاء وتعديل مكونات Livewire، باستخدام توجيهات wire: مثل نموذج والنقر والتحميل، وفي الوقت نفسه تنفيذ جزر أو إجراءات متسلسلة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم، باستخدام أنماط Livewire 4 وتوثيقها."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating dynamic Livewire components with wire: directives","Implementing async actions for improved performance","Writing comprehensive tests for Livewire components"],"zh":["使用 wire: 指令创建动态 Livewire 组件","实现异步操作以提高性能","为 Livewire 组件编写全面的测试"],"ja":["wire: ディレクティブを使用して動的な Livewire コンポーネントを作成する","非同期アクションを実装してパフォーマンスを向上させる","Livewire コンポーネントのための包括的なテストを書く"],"ko":["wire: 지시문을 사용하여 동적 Livewire 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","비동기 동작을 구현하여 성능을 향상시키는 것","Livewire 컴포넌트에 대한 포괄적인 테스트를 작성하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes Livewire dinámicos con directivas wire:","Implementación de acciones asíncronas para mejorar el rendimiento","Escritura de pruebas exhaustivas para componentes Livewire"],"fr":["Création de composants Livewire dynamiques avec des directives wire:","Mise en œuvre d''actions asynchrones pour améliorer les performances","Écriture de tests complets pour les composants Livewire"],"de":["Erstellung dynamischer Livewire-Komponenten mit wire:-Direktiven","Implementierung asynchroner Aktionen zur Leistungsverbesserung","Schreiben umfassender Tests für Livewire-Komponenten"],"pt":["Criar componentes Livewire dinâmicos com diretivas wire:","Implementar ações assíncronas para melhorar o desempenho","Escrever testes abrangentes para componentes Livewire"],"ru":["Создание динамических компонентов Livewire с директивами wire:","Реализация асинхронных действий для улучшения производительности","Написание комплексных тестов для компонентов Livewire"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Livewire ديناميكية مع توجيهات wire:","تنفيذ إجراءات متسلسلة لتحسين الأداء","كتابة اختبارات شاملة لمكونات Livewire"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Livewire 4 knowledge and setup","Specific to Livewire development, not applicable to other frameworks"],"zh":["需要 Livewire 4 知识和设置","仅适用于 Livewire 开发，不适用于其他框架"],"ja":["Livewire 4 の知識と設定が必要","Livewire 開発専用で、他のフレームワークには適用できない"],"ko":["Livewire 4 지식과 설정이 필요함","Livewire 개발에만 특화되어 있으며, 다른 프레임워크에는 적용할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento y configuración de Livewire 4","Específico para el desarrollo de Livewire, no aplicable a otros frameworks"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances et une configuration Livewire 4","Spécifique au développement Livewire, non applicable à d''autres frameworks"],"de":["Benötigt Livewire-4-Kenntnisse und -Einrichtung","Spezifisch für die Livewire-Entwicklung, nicht anwendbar auf andere Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento e configuração do Livewire 4","Específico para o desenvolvimento do Livewire, não aplicável a outros frameworks"],"ru":["Требует знания и настройки Livewire 4","Конкретно для разработки Livewire, не применимо к другим фреймворкам"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة وإعداد Livewire 4","محدد لتطوير Livewire، لا ينطبق على إطارات عمل أخرى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ccd42a705fb451463fbb79eaa7658b68ff6fa9794c034e1bcd1b7bd39f5f530f","qualityScore":45}');
